#
# R5-built packages are not stored in git. Each one is the asset of the
# GitHub Release "pkg-<name>-<version>" of r5-operating-system/r5os:
#   https://github.com/r5-operating-system/r5os/releases/download/pkg-<name>-<version>/<file>
# scripts/r5-packages.sh fetches a package into the local cache and stops on
# a wrong sha256. scripts/publish-package.sh uploads a new one and writes its
# line here. r5servo keeps its own pin in distro/servo/r5servo.sha256.
#
# Roles:
#   image  copied to the download folder and put in r5-opengl.repo
#   skia   build-only; unpacked to the Skia staging tree when that is missing
#   base   input of a packing script (pack-radv.py, pack-lavapipe.py,
#          build-vkcube.sh); fetched only when that script runs
#
# file	sha256	role
